{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heal<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/heal-title.gif?t=1741633628\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing as the healer, you have the all-important role of keeping your friends alive. Click with your mouse to cast healing spells. Don\u2019t let your warband die!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/warband-title.gif?t=1741633628\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit new members to your warband. Try out different formations on the battlefield. Unlock allies such as fiery mages and tanky tanks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/die-title.gif?t=1741633628\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't win them all. Even if the battle is lost, the war has just begun! Patch yourself up at home base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/upgrade-title.gif?t=1741633628\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The upgrade tree is full of surprises, explore and see what\u2019s hiding behind the branches.\u00a0Spend your well earned currency and upgrade your powers. Repeat!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2467850?t=1741633628","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741633628","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/e99a53994e447621c43a963549987bd0693fe75c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741633628","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/e99a53994e447621c43a963549987bd0693fe75c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741633628","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3462500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heal<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/heal-title.gif?t=1741633628\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing as the healer, you have the all-important role of keeping your friends alive. Click with your mouse to cast healing spells. Don\u2019t let your warband die!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/warband-title.gif?t=1741633628\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit new members to your warband. Try out different formations on the battlefield. Unlock allies such as fiery mages and tanky tanks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/die-title.gif?t=1741633628\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't win them all. Even if the battle is lost, the war has just begun! Patch yourself up at home base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/upgrade-title.gif?t=1741633628\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The upgrade tree is full of surprises, explore and see what\u2019s hiding behind the branches.\u00a0Spend your well earned currency and upgrade your powers. Repeat!</p>","developers":["Cuddle Monster Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor